1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,625
In the darkness of the sea,

2
00:00:01,625 --> 00:00:03,111
inside a great fish,

3
00:00:03,111 --> 00:00:04,238
one prophet called

4
00:00:04,238 --> 00:00:05,573
out to Allah.

5
00:00:05,573 --> 00:00:07,546
And Allah answered him.

6
00:00:07,546 --> 00:00:09,787
This is the story of Yunus,

7
00:00:09,787 --> 00:00:11,204
peace be upon him,

8
00:00:11,204 --> 00:00:12,028
told the way

9
00:00:12,028 --> 00:00:13,677
the Quran tells it.

10
00:00:13,677 --> 00:00:14,861
Allah says:

11
00:00:14,861 --> 00:00:16,057
And indeed,

12
00:00:16,057 --> 00:00:17,276
Yunus was among

13
00:00:17,276 --> 00:00:18,344
the messengers.

14
00:00:18,344 --> 00:00:20,190
He was sent to his people,

15
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:20,759
to call

16
00:00:20,759 --> 00:00:23,058
them to worship Allah alone.

17
00:00:23,058 --> 00:00:24,184
The Prophet Muhammad,

18
00:00:24,184 --> 00:00:25,310
peace and blessings

19
00:00:25,310 --> 00:00:26,065
be upon him,

20
00:00:26,065 --> 00:00:26,947
said:

21
00:00:26,947 --> 00:00:28,747
No servant should say

22
00:00:28,747 --> 00:00:29,850
that I am better

23
00:00:29,850 --> 00:00:31,580
than Yunus bin Matta.

24
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:34,657
That is in Sahih al-Bukhari.

25
00:00:34,657 --> 00:00:35,539
Yunus called

26
00:00:35,539 --> 00:00:37,153
his people to Allah.

27
00:00:37,153 --> 00:00:38,349
Then, the Quran says,

28
00:00:38,349 --> 00:00:39,753
he went off in anger.

29
00:00:39,753 --> 00:00:40,984
He went to a ship,

30
00:00:40,984 --> 00:00:42,087
fully loaded,

31
00:00:42,087 --> 00:00:44,072
and set out on the sea.

32
00:00:44,072 --> 00:00:44,873
On the ship,

33
00:00:44,873 --> 00:00:46,174
lots were drawn.

34
00:00:46,174 --> 00:00:47,776
And Yunus was among

35
00:00:47,776 --> 00:00:48,832
the losers.

36
00:00:48,832 --> 00:00:50,748
Then the fish swallowed him.

37
00:00:50,748 --> 00:00:51,920
Allah calls him

38
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,360
the man of the fish,

39
00:00:53,360 --> 00:00:54,370
and the companion

40
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:55,670
of the fish.

41
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:57,064
Inside the fish,

42
00:00:57,064 --> 00:00:58,794
within the darknesses,

43
00:00:58,794 --> 00:01:00,605
Yunus called out.

44
00:01:00,605 --> 00:01:01,499
He said:

45
00:01:01,499 --> 00:01:03,681
There is no god except You.

46
00:01:03,681 --> 00:01:05,481
Glory be to You.

47
00:01:05,481 --> 00:01:06,514
Indeed,

48
00:01:06,514 --> 00:01:07,211
I have been

49
00:01:07,211 --> 00:01:08,871
of the wrongdoers.

50
00:01:08,871 --> 00:01:10,253
Allah says:

51
00:01:10,253 --> 00:01:11,727
So We answered him,

52
00:01:11,727 --> 00:01:12,702
and saved him

53
00:01:12,702 --> 00:01:14,293
from the distress.

54
00:01:14,293 --> 00:01:15,442
And this is how

55
00:01:15,442 --> 00:01:17,590
We save the believers.

56
00:01:17,590 --> 00:01:18,716
And had he not been

57
00:01:18,716 --> 00:01:20,818
of those who glorify Allah,

58
00:01:20,818 --> 00:01:22,315
he would have stayed inside

59
00:01:22,315 --> 00:01:23,337
its belly until

60
00:01:23,337 --> 00:01:24,161
the Day people

61
00:01:24,161 --> 00:01:25,833
are raised again.

62
00:01:25,833 --> 00:01:26,680
The Prophet,

63
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:27,934
peace and blessings

64
00:01:27,934 --> 00:01:28,979
be upon him,

65
00:01:28,979 --> 00:01:30,813
said that no Muslim calls

66
00:01:30,813 --> 00:01:32,253
on Allah with this prayer,

67
00:01:32,253 --> 00:01:33,135
for anything,

68
00:01:33,135 --> 00:01:34,610
except that Allah

69
00:01:34,610 --> 00:01:35,968
answers him.

70
00:01:35,968 --> 00:01:36,375
That is

71
00:01:36,375 --> 00:01:37,187
in the collection

72
00:01:37,187 --> 00:01:38,383
of at-Tirmidhi,

73
00:01:38,383 --> 00:01:39,695
and scholars graded

74
00:01:39,695 --> 00:01:41,135
it authentic.

75
00:01:41,135 --> 00:01:42,354
Then the fish cast

76
00:01:42,354 --> 00:01:44,177
him onto the open shore,

77
00:01:44,177 --> 00:01:45,535
and he was ill.

78
00:01:45,535 --> 00:01:46,638
And Allah made

79
00:01:46,638 --> 00:01:48,717
a gourd vine grow over him,

80
00:01:48,717 --> 00:01:50,354
to give him shade.

81
00:01:50,354 --> 00:01:52,316
And his Lord chose him,

82
00:01:52,316 --> 00:01:53,082
and made him

83
00:01:53,082 --> 00:01:54,521
one of the righteous.

84
00:01:54,521 --> 00:01:56,147
Then Allah sent him

85
00:01:56,147 --> 00:01:58,364
to a hundred thousand people,

86
00:01:58,364 --> 00:01:59,340
or more.

87
00:01:59,340 --> 00:02:01,093
And they believed.

88
00:02:01,093 --> 00:02:02,904
So Allah let them enjoy

89
00:02:02,904 --> 00:02:04,680
their lives for a time.

90
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,772
The Quran says

91
00:02:05,772 --> 00:02:07,142
there was no town

92
00:02:07,142 --> 00:02:08,825
whose faith benefited it,

93
00:02:08,825 --> 00:02:10,950
except the people of Yunus.

94
00:02:10,950 --> 00:02:12,238
When they believed,

95
00:02:12,238 --> 00:02:13,341
Allah removed

96
00:02:13,341 --> 00:02:15,001
from them the punishment

97
00:02:15,001 --> 00:02:17,161
of disgrace in this life.

98
00:02:17,161 --> 00:02:19,274
Darkness all around him.

99
00:02:19,274 --> 00:02:20,238
And still,

100
00:02:20,238 --> 00:02:22,037
his prayer was heard.

101
00:02:22,037 --> 00:02:23,999
Whatever darkness you are in,

102
00:02:23,999 --> 00:02:26,646
call on Allah as Yunus did.

103
00:02:26,646 --> 00:02:29,073
There is no god except You.

104
00:02:29,073 --> 00:02:30,791
Glory be to You.

105
00:02:30,791 --> 00:02:31,522
Indeed,

106
00:02:31,522 --> 00:02:32,358
I have been

107
00:02:32,358 --> 00:02:33,798
of the wrongdoers.

108
00:02:33,798 --> 00:02:35,807
That is the story of Yunus.
